  <item>
    <title>《毒舌律师》的疑惑:律师为什么要为“坏人”辩护</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642bed0166e4c00c6a2f61d8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642bed0166e4c00c6a2f61d8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Apr 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span><br><span>《毒舌律师》以律师用口才和智慧为弱势群体打赢官司的故事让我们一下子重返香港律政剧红火的年代，而律师们却通过这部剧重新审视自己当律师的初衷是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>律师既然是伸张正义的，为什么又要帮坏人辩护呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个小白当事人该如何选择适合自己的律师？是选年纪大资历深的？还是选年轻有干劲的？还是找一个相处舒服的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>接了案子以后，律师与当事人是做朋友还是保持距离呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期阵容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>66律师：</span></p><span></span><p><span>家庭守护者/婚姻家事律师/新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_V1tXXrYn-tabE9Fq8ui5EKBB5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>且且：</span></p><span></span><p><span>前媒体人/十年民生记者/新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiO400G9Y5WdgFA0PtNRwpbRNnot.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>潘禹辰律师：</span></p><span></span><p><span>商事、财税律师，专注于文化娱乐、新消费、新经济</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9Ln8TA-sg6zl0cNTU0JW1lWums.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>孙鹏远律师：</span></p><span></span><p><span>刑辩律师/推理爱好者</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiC3TvFIrzTbx-9BvYo4Ryj9V6dw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">2:13</a> 做律师的初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">3:06</a> 做律师赚不了大钱 更多是解决麻烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">4:46</a> 能在剧中每个律师身上看到自己的影子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 律师正气的底层是情感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">8:56</a> 客户应该怎么选择律师？有目标式、择偶式、资历、年纪……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> 客户喜欢霸气式碾压式的律师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> 律师和当事人是做朋友好还是保持距离好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 律师为什么要为“坏人”辩护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a> 怎么样才能从破败的婚姻里脱离出来</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnQmOIui5PUs1D4BImJh7FVcm6tO.m4a" length="99187508" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn61OFra7UVq4ct4ivhlHpkmfh2n.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>罚得多=挣得多？从明星缴税看税法</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fe476eb91c17e69c84205d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fe476eb91c17e69c84205d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Feb 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>新闻报道中的明星偷漏税事件，为何有人要入刑，而有人是罚款？罚款金额越大意味着赚的越多吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为何很多影视公司选择在霍尔果斯、海口开设公司？</span></p><span></span><p><span>金税四期与金税三期的区别在哪儿？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近，热播剧《显微镜下的大明》中上演了很多税收的剧情。税收之于国家，是基石，是根本，是驱动力，亦是底线。税收之于个人，更是义务。今天，我们就来聊聊【税收】这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*制作人注：本期涉及到敏感案件采用了消音处理，听感上可能造成不适，恳请大家谅解。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="112">1:52</a> 罚得多=挣得多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">5:49</a> 税局查税的两种方式：核定征收、查账征收</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">8:40</a> 金税四期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">9:38</a> 公司扎堆在霍尔果斯办公司？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 从明星案例看税法改革</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> 直播行业的风险预警</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 举报、上下游、大数据—税局盯上你的几种方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 公司与个人，都要有敏锐的税务意识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 税收是国家的根本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> 各地政府为吸纳人才而实施的税收政策</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期阵容</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜主持：xinyi，66律师</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FppCH47bQA1BRYq9rWC7A0HNXELc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>｜本期嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span>潘禹辰律师——商事、财税律师，专注于文化娱乐、新消费、新经济</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9Ln8TA-sg6zl0cNTU0JW1lWums.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>｜出品方：PoPoPod</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作人：@丝丝丝</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小 编：@灿烂</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜实习编辑：@孙梦娟</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvQpgUSYddinKoGdtKPWurawmRlf.m4a" length="47659229" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn61OFra7UVq4ct4ivhlHpkmfh2n.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>老板我不是真的辞职，你为什么不拉住我？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f52297e99bdef7d33e4ae2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f52297e99bdef7d33e4ae2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Feb 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>感情中最忌讳时常提“分手”，同样，职场人最尴尬的事之一就是提出离职但最终没走。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有了嫌隙的工作，员工和老板都饱受煎熬！</span></p><span></span><p><span>员工：上一秒“这个气谁爱受谁受着，老子不干了！”，下一秒“老板我是开玩笑的”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>老板：扛过了金融危机，扛过了疫情，我却倒在了00后的职场大整顿里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着农历春节的结束，一年一度辞职大潮 暗流涌动。今天我们就来聊聊「辞职」。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a>说出辞职但没走但人有多尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a>画饼我们是提倡的，但不要虚假宣传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a>有些辞职是真的想辞职吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 作为老板，员工提离职的时候我在想什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>复合后的蜜月期，在职场也存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 保住面子的一次成功的离职</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 辞职一定要被老板批准才能走吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a>劳动法对劳动者的保护和推动社会进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> “00后整顿职场”也是社会进步驱动出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a>职责划分在入职时就该明确清楚，可以减少很多麻烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a>千奇百怪的离职理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2338">38:58</a>难受的只有打工人？老板其实也不好过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a>劳动者权益被侵犯的时候，不需要与老板共情</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期阵容</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜主持：xinyi，66律师</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlixkpmF6rxV7HR8dwl_hz4Roy08.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>｜嘉宾：张乐律师，律师事务所合伙人，法律服务部boss，任多家公司法律顾问</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZR-Z37plrgZpT5xWSAEy1TFZZi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>｜出品方：PoPoPod</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作人：@丝丝丝</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小 编：@灿烂</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜实习生：梦梦，佳玲</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq6wZa5uxPketV7pDxta-wIaSZtK.m4a" length="69554233" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn61OFra7UVq4ct4ivhlHpkmfh2n.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>刑辩律师：高启强你这样当大佬是不行的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ebcf3b51a4e4150a79632c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ebcf3b51a4e4150a79632c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>刑辩律师看《狂飙》，内心可能在狂笑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当年收保护费的唐小龙、唐小虎属于黑社会性质组织吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>高启强团伙无恶不作，但坚决不许弟弟高启盛贩毒的原因是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>孟钰背着高奢包却不知道老公受贿，这说得过去吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果大嫂陈书婷与高启强离婚，夫妻财产分割要怎么算？</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着开年爆剧《狂飙》的完结，剧中的遗留问题在网友的拆解下，衍生出很多戏里戏外的解读。这些解读，在刑事犯罪辩护律师眼中，离真正的法律视角还相差很远。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期《听说了吗》邀请资深刑辩律师孙鹏远，从刑法角度聊聊他理解的《狂飙》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们反复申明：可以感性看剧，但要理性看人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好人再“讨厌”，终究是好人；坏人再“可爱”，也还是坏人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大嫂再美，也得守法。</span></p><span></span><p><span>坚决同一切违规违纪违法现象做斗争，正邪不两立，是非有分明。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 观众认可的是演员张颂文，而不是角色高启强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 当影视剧里的黑老大深情而绝后…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 高启强为什么坚决不许弟弟涉毒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="926">15:26</a> “黑社会”的判定标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 电鱼也是违法行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 如果“强盛集团”高启强是女人……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 女性犯罪集团的犯罪特征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1667">27:47</a> 高启强与陈书婷离婚，财产会如何分割？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 孟钰的爱马仕包会不会被收缴？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a> 影视剧对青少年的引导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 收集证据是人人都要学会的技能</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜本期阵容：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhmDcexT7Hj_7i40gKRxeJpVabwC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>｜混剪Bgm来源：@小熊餅乾屋 @司墨尧smile</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜出品方：PoPoPod</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜制作人：@丝丝丝</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜小 编：@灿烂</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ni7nqWLOGcFBR-QziCL2omhNFBrm.mp3" length="55435768" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn61OFra7UVq4ct4ivhlHpkmfh2n.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>长大后的我，可以教育父母了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63c6e0daeab1781ef439c3bc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63c6e0daeab1781ef439c3bc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Jan 2023 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这或许是一期春节家庭相处指南。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着健康环境的变化，有人失去了挚爱亲人，有人重获新生。但有一些问题，在近期一直困扰着我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>指出父母的错误就是“不孝”了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟着时代成长起来的我们，逐渐掌握了父母没有的知识和技能，我们可以开始教育父母了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>当长大后的我们，有了自己的事业、家庭、圈子，我们需要听太多人的话，却不一定再听进去父母的话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有儿时打碎玩具手足无措的我们，就有长大后小心翼翼说话的父母。曾经那些批评与被批评的时刻如今也会重演，只是可能我们成了强势的一方。曾经面对柴米油盐、养家奋斗、总是像超人一样的父母，现在却怎么也追不上这变幻莫测的时代，被隔绝在我们的世界之外。</span></p><span></span><p><span>然而，我们都清楚，彼此永远是彼此的软肋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对父母“向上管理”时，保护他们的面子，照顾他们的情绪，我们都要学会表达歉意和爱意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是春节前的最后一期，也是我们送给团圆年的礼物。愿人人健康，家家团圆。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>丝丝，播客《听说了吗》制作人</span></p><span></span><p><span>添乐，播客《瓜儿与少年》主播</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 对父母，善用”捧杀“一招！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 30+了还有门禁，成年后还需报备吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 长大后怎么和父母聊事情的是非对错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 专门为老年人洗脑的保健品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 用什么方法可以让父母远离智商税</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 父母抗拒新产品，认为是交智商税</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 如何给异地的父母提建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 怎么看待父母在家庭群转发”专家“消息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> 学习偶尔“pua”一下父母</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">31:43</a> 长大了就可以教育父母吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 法律案例：母亲要跟新男友结婚，如何保全女儿继承权？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 不要说“这都是为你好”，我不听我不听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2154">35:54</a> 父母吵架，自己夹在中间清官也难断</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 干涉父母太多，也很让父母窒息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a> 有一对比自己还会玩的父母，是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a> 每代人有每代人的生活方式，要允许老人试错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 无良商家，你的良心不会痛吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3076">51:16</a> 珍惜和父母的缘分，好好和父母说话</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主持：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>66：</span></p><span></span><p><span>家庭守护者 / 婚姻家事律师 /新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvnCUKFt7HNzCoB8uTGQxFQtpvXN.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>且且：</span></p><span></span><p><span>前媒体人 / 十年民生记者 /新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FgkLdvnFwCq5PYLDTkfpPNh89ihf.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>爱情/婚姻/生活漫谈/微普法的播客</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FutxwPJGGv1dJaq9cNf7c6NagnjP.jpg"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群】请加小助手微信：lvshi-66</span></p>]]></description>
