  <item>
    <title>加更！从法律分析汪小菲为何如此愤怒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637f67f9882ce82fb6458efe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637f67f9882ce82fb6458efe</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 12:47:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>汪小菲“疯”了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然这不是他第一次与前妻大s对线，但这一次大s及母亲似乎点了汪小菲的“发疯穴”，让这位北京爷们儿彻底绷不住了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是普通人还是明星，离婚财产分配和孩子的抚养权，永远是双方博弈的重中之重。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目临时加更，关于大s和汪小菲的内容均来自双方微博及网络新闻，有关离婚协议也纯属我们的猜测，但所有分析都有法可依。希望大家谨慎吃瓜，严肃学法。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">1:33</a>截止本期录制时的八卦点总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a>离婚后为什么要对前妻支付“赡养费”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a>没人能强迫赡养，除非汪小菲自愿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a>大s申请法院强制执行的依据</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a>再次强调：婚内出轨不影响财产分割</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a>签署离婚协议，切勿盲目自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a>大s为什么获得了更多的声援？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1266">21:06</a>孩子判给谁是婚后财产划分的关键点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a>探望孩子的权利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> 66律师专业建议：少说话，不撕逼，学会示弱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a>起诉书也要体面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a>汪小菲如何能得到更多权益保障？请个专业律师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a>离婚后能约束对方不能再婚吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a>「夺回我失去的一切」不适用于离婚协议完成之后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">41:42</a>call back本专辑第一期离婚案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a>心甘情愿的付出，不需要用后悔来救赎</span></p>]]></description>
