  <item>
    <title>66律师首次个人秀，回应粉丝提问</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636aa749a5004aa3aa570ffe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636aa749a5004aa3aa570ffe</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Nov 2022 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期特别的录制，66律师在出差途中一个人完成了我们节目上线以来的第一个“女律师个人主打秀”。因为录制条件、时间都有限，所以它很mini。</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然mini，但满满干货。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目有粉丝群里的答疑解惑，有律师行业的真实现状，也有66律师从业多年沉淀出的「舍」与「得」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们从一位粉丝的“彩礼”说起。</span></p><span></span><p><span>彩礼算不算婚前财产？结婚时父母赠与的财物，离婚时要如何保住？父母送房、送车，都会被平分，但「保单」能将个人财产最大化，这是不是算计？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们不是教你算计，只是希望在必要时，你能学会用法律保护自己。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">2:33</a>彩礼算不算婚前财产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="263">4:23</a>什么情况下彩礼才是共同财产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">6:30</a>婆家准备的婚房，也有可能不算“聘礼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">7:46</a>婚前自己买的房，竟不是婚前财产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>保单，财产保护利器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a>我继承的财产也被默认是夫妻共同财产？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> 放弃也是一种松弛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> &nbsp;66律师:努力成为可以挑选委托人的律师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a>探讨律师的自由和不自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a>律师行业光鲜背后的辛酸</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>66：</span></p><span></span><p><span>家庭守护者 / 婚姻家事律师 /新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvnCUKFt7HNzCoB8uTGQxFQtpvXN.jpg"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群】请加小助手微信：lvshi-66</span></p>]]></description>
