  <item>
    <title>每段两性关系里一定有个“第三者”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6361144c2e925d51c11946a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6361144c2e925d51c11946a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Nov 2022 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>简介：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>夫妻二人是整日粘在一起的日子好？还是各玩各的好？</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么都要操心你掌控你的“霸道总裁”是真爱，还是给你自由随你玩乐的老公是真爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个个体都有自己的情感体系，遇到同类是幸运，但大部分人很难遇到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，且且和66律师邀请回全职太太姬如，聊聊婚姻里的第三者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>第三者，每段两性关系里一定都会有吗？这次“第三者”被定义为姐妹聚会、兄弟打球、异地恋的距离……等等夫妻双方解绑的各种方法，你会听到很多她们在婚姻里与另一半的相处智慧。而本期嘉宾的夫妻相处之道，或许跟感情中的很多男女不一样，也欢迎到评论区发表你的观点。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a>结婚后一生都对伴侣忠诚无间是不可能的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a>“夫妻连体人”是种什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a>法律管不着夫妻的相处之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1137">18:57</a>真能影响关系的还得是真真正正的第三者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a>学会与爱人“解绑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1856">30:56</a>当“第三者”是孩子、公公、婆婆……我该如何表达不满？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a>亲密关系里，谁痛苦，谁就去改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2401">40:01</a>相对“开放”并非一定就是更好的婚姻模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2877">47:57</a>夫妻间是相互“pua”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a>一起离婚案：你会原谅出轨的老公吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a>试试把爱情与婚姻分开看</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>姬如，一位有着8年全职状态的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span>她说：在我的“全职生涯”里，我始终以愉悦自己为目标，让全职生活积极而丰富！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsruBtjEGSbrXWKV7kG64c6oOf-S.gif"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主持：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>66：</span></p><span></span><p><span>家庭守护者 / 婚姻家事律师 /新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvnCUKFt7HNzCoB8uTGQxFQtpvXN.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>且且：</span></p><span></span><p><span>前媒体人 / 十年民生记者 /新手妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FgkLdvnFwCq5PYLDTkfpPNh89ihf.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span>爱情/婚姻/生活漫谈/微普法的播客</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FutxwPJGGv1dJaq9cNf7c6NagnjP.jpg"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群】请加小助手微信：lvshi-66</span></p>]]></description>
